OL,3,ANHS boss warns of 'horrible spike' in
OL,4,Aflu as hospital admissions surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutgoing chief executive for NHS
OL,7,FEngland, Sir Jim Mackey, talked of how
OL,8,Fsome hospitals had introduced
OL,9,Fmask-wearing to stem the spread of
OL,10,Frespiratory illnesses.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
