OL,3,AImmigration stats are down but will
OL,4,Athat be the end of the issue?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNet migration falling to the tens of
OL,7,Fthousands is a landmark moment in our
OL,8,Fcollective national conversation about
OL,9,Fimmigration over the last couple of
OL,10,Fdecades.
OL,12,FThere is a simple reason for this. We
OL,13,Fhave had years and years strewn with
OL,14,Fthe litter of politicians promising to
OL,15,Fcut net migration to under 100,000
OL,16,Fannually.
OL,18,FBut it never happened, until now.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795769744
